The '''Palace of Zhifol'''<!--Książ Castle--> is the [[wikipedia:ancestral home|ancestral castle]] and [[wikipedia:official residence|official residence]] of the [[House of Zhifol]]. It is located ?? kilometers northwest of [[Zhol]] in the town of [[Zhifol]]. 

The palace contains 400 rooms and occupies an area of approximately 11,000 square meters. 

